        浼唬鐮佸潡 := ""
    PromptGenerator(args, fragment, pseudocode=浼唬鐮佸潡):
        load_fragment()
        if _skip_prompt_build: return              # 浠?_generate_pseudocode 璧拌繖鏉℃嵎寰?        construct_adaptive_icl()
        if use_rag: rag.inject_fragment_context()   # 鏂囨。绾?RAG
        if use_progressive_kb: progressive_kb.retrieve()
        if generics 妯″紡: generics_rule_lib.match_rules()
        if use_grammar_prompt: get_grammar_prompt() 鈫?grammar_context
        if use_syntax_rag: syntax_graph_rag.inject(source_fragment_body) 鈫?syntax_graph_context
        build_base_prompt():
            persona 鈫?instruction 鈫?grammar(Part2) 鈫?java婧?鈫?            pseudocode_bridge(Part1) 鈫?partial_translation 鈫?generics 鈫?            kb few-shot 鈫?RAG 鏂囨。 鈫?syntax graph 绀轰緥(Part3) 鈫?            ICL 鈫?feedback 鈫?"### Response:"
    LLM call 鈫?JSON {code, reasoning, imports}
    extract_json_translation() 鈫?syntactic check 鈫?cangjie_compilation_validation()
    if 缂栬瘧澶辫触: feedback = 缂栬瘧閿欒; 璺冲洖 PromptGenerator 閲嶅缓甯?feedback
    if 缂栬瘧鎴愬姛: (skip_mock=false 鏃? mock 娴嬭瘯 鈫?缁х画鎴栧洖閫€
    translation_status = success / fallback:*
```

